            "detailed_description": "To commemorate Kou Shibusawa's 35th anniversary, the &quot;Kou Shibusawa Archives&quot; will be opened in the Steam Store. Here we will revive popular previously released titles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this sixth round of releases, we offer &quot;Romance of the Three Kingdoms Ⅵ with Power Up Kit,&quot; an expanded version of the 6th game in the series. <br />\r\n&quot;Time of the Heavens&quot; is depicted in dramatic historical events that enliven the world of the Three Kingdoms. &quot;Advantage of the Land&quot; gives strategic advantages based on castle location, economic strengths in farming and trade, and so on. &quot;Bonds of People&quot; allow people to tell their dreams and listen to the opinions of other officers. Use Time, Advantage and Bonds to conquer the continent.",
